1
00:00:00,928 --> 00:00:02,498
(Bernadette:)Sure, sometimes.

2
00:00:02,496 --> 00:00:03,666
(Bernadette:)I mean, it can be
a little awkward

3
00:00:03,664 --> 00:00:06,134
(Bernadette:)since I make so much more money
than Howie.

4
00:00:07,168 --> 00:00:10,368
(Howard:)You didn't have to say
"so much more."

5
00:00:10,371 --> 00:00:11,901
(Bernadette:)Well, I didn't have to,
but for the sake of accuracy

6
00:00:11,906 --> 00:00:13,906
(Bernadette:)I felt that I should.

7
00:00:14,875 --> 00:00:16,575
(Howard:)I brought a lot of
significant assets

8
00:00:16,577 --> 00:00:18,247
(Howard:)into the
relationship, too.

9
00:00:18,245 --> 00:00:22,115
(Bernadette:)Like what? Your incomplete set
of Star Trek collector plates?

10
00:00:23,350 --> 00:00:24,550
(Howard:)For your information,
I just bought the last one

11
00:00:24,552 --> 00:00:26,882
(Howard:)I needed on eBay.

12
00:00:26,887 --> 00:00:28,587
(Bernadette:)Without asking me?

13
00:00:28,589 --> 00:00:31,659
(Howard:)There were only three minutes
left in the auction

14
00:00:31,659 --> 00:00:35,899
(Howard:)and it was a mint condition
Scotty from a smoke-free home.

15
00:00:38,232 --> 00:00:39,232
(Bernadette:)How much, Howie?

16
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:40,203
(Howard:)Not a lot.

17
00:00:40,201 --> 00:00:42,131
(Bernadette:)How much?

18
00:00:42,136 --> 00:00:45,366
(Howard:)Let's not talk about this
in front of our friends.

19
00:00:45,372 --> 00:00:48,642
(Bernadette:)Was it more or less
than falconry school?

20
00:00:50,544 --> 00:00:55,084
(Howard:)For the tenth time,
that was a Groupon.

21
00:00:56,050 --> 00:01:01,020
(Leonard:)Like I would swing
with him.

